<title>UK: Woolwich B/S sets 150 million stg perpetual.</title>
<headline>Woolwich B/S sets 150 million stg perpetual.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CS First Boston and HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WOOLWICH BUILDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY   *PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    27.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+125 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p>	     *CALL AT PAR AFTER 25 YEARS AND THEN EVERY FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>		IF NOT CALLED, COUPON WILL BE RESET TO GIVE 225 B.P.</p>
<p>		YIELD SPREAD OVER PREVAILING FIVE-YEAR GILT.</p>
<p>		SUBORDINATED ISSUE.</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.375     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.00 PCT GILT DUE 2021 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
